# Cursor Rules for Oisha-OS Monorepo

Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/agents/three-agent-workflow.md` before making changes.

## Skills & Operations:
- Tax operations & compliance: `.cursor/rules/soliq-ops.mdc` -> `.agents/skills/soliq-ops/SKILL.md`
- Preflight & test verification: `.cursor/rules/preflight.mdc` -> `.agents/skills/preflight/SKILL.md`
- PR steward & CI: `.cursor/rules/steward.mdc` -> `.agents/skills/steward/SKILL.md`
- Telegram lead sync: `.agents/skills/community-lead-sync/SKILL.md`

All reusable agent skills are located in `.agents/skills/` (mirrored from `.claude/skills/`).
Always follow the modular code standard (150-400 lines) and zero fabrication rules in `AGENTS.md`.
